 "text": "Auditor & Welfare Office - Douglas County, South Dakota\nOctober 18, 2026\nDouglas County, South Dakota\nHome\nDirectory\nAuditor & Welfare Office\nCommunity Health Nurse\nDirector of Equalization\nDrainage\nEmergency Management\nHighway Department\nExtension/4-H\nPlanning and Zoning\nRegister of Deeds\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Services\nCommission\nOrdinances\nCommissioners\nCommission Meetings\nCommission Minutes\nLaw & Court\nClerk of Courts\nSheriff\nState’s Attorney\nEmployment\nNotices\nAuditor & Welfare Office\nAuditor: Melissa Bowers\nDeputy Auditor: Yaquelin Hawley\nPO BOX 159\nArmour, SD 57313\nPhone: 605-724-2423\nemail: melissa.bowers@douglas.sdcounty.gov\nVOTER INFORMATION:\nVoter Registration Form 2026\nAbsentee Request Form 2026\nTAX LEVY INFORMATION:\n2025 Taxes Payable 2026:\nPT73 Towns Pay26\nPT73 Schools pay26\nPT74 pay26\nPT75 pay26\n2024 Taxes Payable 2025:\nPT 73 pay25-TOWNS\nPT 73 pay25-SCHOOLS\nPT74 pay25\nPT 75 pay25\n2023 Taxes Payable 2024:\nPT73 SCHOOLS pay 24\nPT73 TOWNS pay 24\nPT74 pay 24\nPT75 pay 24\n2025 Annual Report:\nPublished 2025 Annual Report\nDEPARTMENT OF LEGISLATIVE AUDIT:\nAudit Report for the two years ending December 31, 2024:\nhttps://legislativeaudit.sd.gov/reports/County/DouglasCounty2024-2023.pdf\nAudit Report for the two years ending December 31, 2022:\nhttps://legislativeaudit.sd.gov/reports/County/DouglasCounty2022-2021.pdf\nBURN BAN\nThe Burn Ban has TEMPORARILY been lifted. Please burn responsibly.\nCommissioner Meetings\n1st and 3rd Tuesday of each month. 9:00 a.m.\nDrivers Licensing\n2nd and 3rd Thursday of the month\n9:30 a.m. - 2:30 p.m.\nCommunity Room, 1st floor of Courthouse\nTREASURERS OFFICE: Vehicle Registration Renewals\nIn an effort to expedite the process, please bring the following with you:\nDrivers License & Registrations or Renewal Postcards for all vehicles.\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
